\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbf91595366c330b\" href=\"?note=fbf91595366c330b\" title=\"93-df-finitely-complete-category\">93-df-finitely-complete-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}\\)</span> (pullback-stable image predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a0e4e3dae0f2467\" href=\"?note=9a0e4e3dae0f2467\" title=\"93-df-stable-images\">93-df-stable-images</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}\\)</span> (pullback-stable finite subobject-union predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbf8e12e31001be4\" href=\"?note=dbf8e12e31001be4\" title=\"93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions\">93-df-stable-finite-subobject-unions</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{CohCat}_{93}(\\mathcal C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land \\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land \\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{CohCat}_{93}(\\mathcal C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FinComplete}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land \\mathrm{StableImg}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land \\mathrm{StableFinUnion}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the finite-limit/stable-image notion of a coherent category. It is distinct from Mac Lane's coherence theorem for associators and unitors in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07f5930ce42abb03\" href=\"?note=07f5930ce42abb03\" title=\"93-thm-maclane-coherence\">93-thm-maclane-coherence</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hy